Z||000011||b lo 0||08-29-2001||07:11 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Dumba$$:<BR><B>dont you think thats odd,<BR>you happen to have a fiero <BR>and the ups guy just happens to drop off a fiero wing?<BR>what are the chances?<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Talk about odd, I FOUND my Fiero wing in the backroom of my body shop class in my senior year.  Factory Fiero wing, guy said some kid had it on a Buick he bought and took it off cause he didn't like it.  Purchased for $40.  What are the odds of having a Fiero, being in body shop, and there being a kid in the same class (albeit different period) who had one and didn't want it?<P><P>------------------<BR><FONT SIZE="1">'85 GT (in progress)<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.angelfire.com/ga3/audioimagery/ice.gif">       <BR>White Lightnin!  (NOT moonshine, for all you hillbillies!)</FONT><BR><A HREF="http://www.audioimagery.vstoreauto.com.com" TARGET=_blank>Audio Imagery</A>, budget-priced car audio supplies from people like Monster Cable, Sony & more!||||reg||1
